  "description": "A PeerLLM skills registry source (the Data nature) for Standard.Agents. Pulls versioned skills\n      from skills.peerllm.com through the same ISkillBroker seam as the built-in file skills — wired\n      with .UseSkills(new PeerLLMSkillBroker(...)). Three sync modes: Live (fetch every request),\n      Local (pull once to a cache), and Hybrid (cache, then re-pull only when a newer version ships).\n      The core Standard.Agents package stays dependency-free; this package only uses HttpClient.",
